   (container units, 1cqw = W/100) like the gear tooltip (itemtip.css), which this builds on (same panel, body font, stat lines, flavor, footer).
   Colours were sampled from the screenshots — the game data has no colour table for the text markup (docs/DATA.md). */

/* plain look (and the base for the game look) */
.d4tt-chrome-item .d4tt-content .nongear .ot-head { display: flex; flex-direction: row-reverse; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px; }
